---
import { getUrl } from '../lib/chapters';
---

<section class="soundtrack-section">
  <div class="soundtrack-container">
    <div class="section-label">ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</div>
    <h2 class="soundtrack-main-title">The Companion Track</h2>

    <div class="soundtrack-card">
      <div class="soundtrack-cover-col">
        <img
          src={getUrl('images/the_wrong_drawing_cover.jpg')}
          alt="Album artwork for The Wrong Drawing by Mark J. Hubrich"
          class="soundtrack-cover"
          width="300"
          height="300"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="soundtrack-info-col">
        <div class="blueprint-badge">AUDIO RECORDING • DWG-001</div>
        <h3 class="song-title">The Wrong Drawing</h3>
        <p class="song-artist">Written & Performed by Mark J. Hubrich</p>
        <p class="song-description">
          A reflective musical companion to the manuscript, written from thirty years of reading steel shop drawings,
          finding the mismatches, and working out how the structural pieces actually fit together.
        </p>

        <!-- HTML Audio Player (No Autoplay) -->
        <div class="audio-player-wrapper">
          <audio controls preload="metadata" class="custom-audio-player">
            <source src={getUrl('audio/the_wrong_drawing.mp3')} type="audio/mpeg" />
            Your browser does not support the audio element.
          </audio>
        </div>

        <!-- Expandable Lyrics Panel -->
        <details class="lyrics-details">
          <summary class="lyrics-summary">
            <span>View Song Lyrics</span>
            <span class="summary-arrow">↓</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="lyrics-content">
            <pre class="lyrics-text">
[Verse 1]
Lines drawn in white on a field of deep blue,
Every dimension is telling you true.
You cut to the mark and you weld to the line,
Hoping the structure holds up over time.

[Chorus]
They handed me the wrong drawing in school,
Described me as broken and broke every rule.
First build with your hands till you feel the steel hold,
Then write out the blueprint in steel, clear and bold.

[Verse 2]
The hallway desk kept the classroom in peace,
While my mind ran a race that would never quite cease.
Not broken, just broadband—a high-density beam,
Connecting the angles of a different dream.

[Outro]
Every bolt, every plate, every column in line,
Reverse engineering this mind of mine.
            </pre>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .soundtrack-section {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .soundtrack-container {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .soundtrack-main-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .soundtrack-card {
    background-color: var(--panel-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .soundtrack-cover-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .soundtrack-cover {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 280px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .blueprint-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    background-color: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
    border: 1px dashed var(--accent-color);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .song-title {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .song-artist {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .song-description {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .audio-player-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .custom-audio-player {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* Expandable Lyrics Panel */
  .lyrics-details {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lyrics-summary {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .lyrics-summary:hover {
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }

  .lyrics-summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
  }

  .lyrics-content {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    background-color: var(--panel-bg);
  }

  .lyrics-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .soundtrack-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .soundtrack-cover-col {
      max-width: 220px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .soundtrack-main-title {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
